    "description": "3 Spotify tricks most listeners never find 👇\n\n1️⃣ Set a sleep timer\nOn the song that's playing, tap the 3-dot menu → Sleep timer and pick how long. The music stops on its own while you fall asleep.\n\n2️⃣ Swipe to add to queue\nIn any playlist or album, swipe a song to the right to add it to your queue. It plays next without changing your playlist.\n\n3️⃣ Try Smart Shuffle\nTap the shuffle button twice to turn on Smart Shuffle. Spotify mixes in new songs that match the vibe of your playlist (Spotify Premium).\n\n💬 Which trick are you trying tonight? Comment 1, 2 or 3!\n\n🔔 Subscribe for quick app tutorials every week.\n\n🌐 More tips and AI prompts: https://keepmesignedin.com\n\n#spotify #spotifytips #music #techtips #playlist #shorts",
